### 正常系：単一拠点（スクショの値）
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/report/power-report/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "corporate_number": "2025071400001",
  "org_id": "TEP",
  "building_id": "2025071400001001001",
  "agreement_category": "11",
  "target_month": "202504"
}

### 正常系：agreement_category 省略（デフォルト '01' を使用）
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/report/power-report/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "corporate_number": "2025071400001",
  "org_id": "TEP",
  "building_id": "2025071400001001001",
  "target_month": "202504"
}

### エラー系：存在しない building_id
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/report/power-report/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "corporate_number": "2025071400001",
  "org_id": "TEP",
  "building_id": "ZZZZ",
  "agreement_category": "11",
  "target_month": "202504"
}

### エラー系：building_id 不足
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/report/power-report/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "corporate_number": "2025071400001",
  "org_id": "TEP",
  "agreement_category": "11",
  "target_month": "202504"
}

### エラー系：building_id = null
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/report/power-report/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "corporate_number": "2025071400001",
  "org_id": "TEP",
  "building_id": null,
  "agreement_category": "11",
  "target_month": "202504"
}

### エラー系：target_month 不足
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/report/power-report/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "corporate_number": "2025071400001",
  "org_id": "TEP",
  "building_id": "2025071400001001001",
  "agreement_category": "11"
}

### 正常系：別建物（ID を差し替えて使用）
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/report/power-report/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "corporate_number": "2025071400001",
  "org_id": "TEP",
  "building_id": "B002",          // ← 実データの拠点IDに置換
  "agreement_category": "11",
  "target_month": "202504"
}
